 "releases": [
  {
   "id": "constance-258950@1.1.3",
   "gameId": "constance-258950",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.1.3",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-09-10T14:07:10.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hi friends,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Patch 1.1.3 is out now, bringing with it the highly requested Constance Recoloring Feature! 🌈",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We thought it would be fun to hide this easter egg behind a little riddle.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "If you’re up for the hunt, here’s your challenge",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Open the page that counts what keeps you alive.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Enter the following 9 inputs in order using the default controls, either on a controller or keyboard.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": true,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "Use the D-pad / arrow keys for directions. On keyboard, use the keys corresponding to the Xbox controller buttons (A, B, X, Y):",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other",
       "platforms": [
        "pc",
        "xboxSeries"
       ]
      },
      {
       "text": "1. The suspended Brain is located ___.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "2. When pressing \\[Input 6], Connie goes ___.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "3. The grey sun hangs to the ___ of where resurgence was found.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "4. ___ to cut your air dash short. 🐇",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "5. The hiding traitor faced ___.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "6. ___ to reach the fastest negative vertical traveling speed.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "7. Four lines lie dead. Take the one toward \\[Input 1]. Its first bend goes ___.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "8. After learning to reach new heights, you left to the ___.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "9. Copycat seven.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Some clues may be easier than others, and you probably won't solve everything on your own. Share your findings, theories, and partial solutions in our Discord and work together to crack the code! https://discord.gg/K3dQ8QUY6",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Happy hunting! :)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Patch Notes 1.1.3.10720",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Added the Constance Recoloring Feature.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Upgraded Unity to 6000.3.23f1.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed saving Snapshots on CrossOver, Sikarugir, and Wine.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Numerous performance improvements and fixes.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44272517/d878f2378b8de2fcf2cc9c48ade9e636aecbe542.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
