  {
   "id": "constance-258950@1.1",
   "gameId": "constance-258950",
   "displayName": "Update 1.1",
   "kind": "major",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2026-03-16T13:26:54.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Hello everybody,",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "It's been a minute!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Today we can finally share with you that our first big update for Constance just went LIVE!ːsteamhappyː",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Let's start with the Patch Notes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Full Arabic language support included",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Various Map improvements including exact tracking of Constance's position within a room, visual indicator of areas discovered with the camera, player trail that shows you your travelled path, some improved room shapes, a new zoom function for the local map and exact Snapshot positions within the map rooms",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Intro, Credits, Cutscenes & Narrative Minigames can now be skipped with a new pause menu",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "New Cursed Game Mode (unlocks after beating the game and serves as our game's \"hard mode\")",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "New Overthinker Modifier (our game's \"permadeath\" modifier - you only get 1 life!)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Chase Sequence: Camera has been unlocked, players can now outrun the boss",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Chase Sequence: Level design adjustments for fairer timings and less frustrating moments",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jester & Jester Encore: players can now attack ALL cards in ALL patterns to damage the bosses",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Jester Encore: Cards are no longer invisible, patterns were improved",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Lord Koba: Timings and some attacks were improved",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A variety of other bosses were improved in terms of timings, awkward pauses and anticipations (i.e. High Patia now communicates properly that she heals while hanging from the ceiling)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added a UI element that communicates better what is actually happening at Jackie's tent",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Added a completion screen at the end of the game",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "new"
      },
      {
       "text": "Various new accessibility options",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Various difficulty and economy balancing adjustments",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Various bug fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Various smaller performance improvements",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We've been working really hard on improving the game as much as we can, incorporating",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "as much of your feedback from Steam, Discord and socials as possible.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We hope you will like the improvements as much as we do!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Below you can find a little video showcase by our director Sebastian regarding the update.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Please keep the feedback coming and have fun playing Constance!💜",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Constance Team",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
