  {
   "id": "constance-258950@1.0.3.98778",
   "gameId": "constance-258950",
   "displayName": "Patch 1.0.3.98778",
   "kind": "patch",
   "kindBasis": "studio",
   "announcedAt": "2025-12-02T19:13:57.000Z",
   "notes": [
    {
     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey everyone,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Today our second Patch for Constance is going live!",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We fixed the most pressing bugs you reported to us and already started with some map improvements. (More to come!)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "When buying the Architect's Blueprint item from the shop you now get a visual indicator on the levels on your map that communicate if all secrets/collectibles have been found in a room.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "title": "Here are the full patch notes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Level-based completion tracking added to the map (unlocks via \"Architect's Blueprint\")",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed the \"Inner Canvas\" achievement (if you qualify, load into any save to receive it)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "PC local time shenanigans no longer break savegame loading",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Snapshot button is now rebindable on controller",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug where Jackie's quest stayed incomplete even though you had all rewards (talk to her again if that's the case for you)",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Fixed a bug where Palettus sometimes glitched through the door, causing a softlock",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "fixed"
      },
      {
       "text": "Broken savegames are now properly ignored during load",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "A handful of additional fixes",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "In just a few days we will also release our \"Post Launch Roadmap\" for Constance so you are aware about the things you can look forward to in the upcoming months.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "Cheers,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "The Constance Team",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "[img src=\"{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/44272517/47a0944b5da784e4dfdc6548a703e58d1ebad796.png\"]",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      }
     ]
    }
   ],
